te, multinational corporate, financial institution, and public sector clients, as well as retail, private banking, wealth management, and family office clients. It has a strategic collaboration with Accenture plc and International Business Machines to establish a new technology operating model combining the resilience of mission-critical systems with the flexibility of cloud, data, and artificial intelligence. UniCredit S.p.A. was founded in 1870 and is headquartered in Milan, Italy.","fullTimeEmployees":65954,"city":"Milan","country":"Italy","website":"https://www.unicreditgroup.eu","industry":"Banks - Regional","sector":"Financial Services"},"news":[{"title":"Commerzbank Raises 2026 Profit Outlook as AI Savings Emerge and UniCredit Integration Nears","link":"https://www.marketbeat.com/instant-alerts/event-commerzbank-raises-2026-profit-outlook-as-ai-savings-emerge-and-unicredit-integration-nears-2026-11-27/?utm_source=yahoofinance&utm_medium=yahoofinance","publisher":"MarketBeat","date":"2026-11-27"},{"title":"UniCredit Seeks Commerzbank Chair Role for CEO Orcel After Takeover Clears Final Hurdle","link":"https://www.wsj.com/business/unicredit-clears-final-hurdle-in-commerzbank-takeover-83ae477f?siteid=yhoof2&yptr=yahoo","publisher":"The Wall Street Journal","date":"2026-11-26"},{"title":"European Indexes Open Sharply Higher After U.S. Recovery","link":"https://www.wsj.com/finance/stocks/nikkei-rises-1-3-led-by-chip-metals-stocks-3b7004c9?siteid=yhoof2&yptr=yahoo","publisher":"The Wall Street Journal","date":"2026-11-26"},{"title":"UniCredit shares gain 3% as final approvals clear path for Commerzbank deal","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/unicredit-clears-final-hurdles-commerzbank-080332730.html","publisher":"Investing.com","date":"2026-11-26"},{"title":"UniCredit secures final Polish approval for Commerzbank takeover bid","link":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/26/unicredit-secures-final-polish-approval-for-commerzbank-takeover-bid","pu